# L1TestsIN config template used by WPEFramework ConfigGenerator during CMake configure.
#
# IMPORTANT:
# ConfigGenerator loads this file as Python, and will ERROR on any non-whitelisted
# variables. Do not define "locator" or "classname" here: those are injected by
# ConfigGenerator itself via the -l/--locator and -c/--classname CLI arguments
# (see install/tools/cmake/FindConfigGenerator.cmake -> write_config()).
#
# This plugin has no additional configuration parameters, so this file is intentionally empty.
